#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:1
msgid "Algorithms"
msgstr "アルゴリズム"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:3
msgid ""
"Pages summarizing how named algorithms from the literature are reproduced"
" as combinations of saealib components. Each page has two parts: a "
"theoretical overview of the algorithm (a general explanation independent "
"of saealib), and how to configure it in saealib (the component "
"combination and Python code). Full bibliographic details for the sources "
"are collected in [References](../references.md), and each page in this "
"section links there."
msgstr "文献上の名前がついたアルゴリズムを、saealibのコンポーネントの組み合わせとしてどう再現するかをまとめたページです。 各ページは、そのアルゴリズムの理論的な概要（saealibに依存しない一般的な説明）と、saealibでの構成方法（コンポーネントの組み合わせとPythonコード）の2部構成です。 出典の完全な書誌情報は[文献リファレンス](../references.md)にまとめてあり、このセクションの各ページはそこへリンクします。"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:7
msgid ""
"Where a configuration does not exactly match the theoretical definition "
"(an approximation), this is noted explicitly on the page."
msgstr "構成が理論上の定義と厳密に一致しない場合（近似）は、各ページにその旨を明記します。"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:13
msgid "EGO"
msgstr "{fa}`crosshairs;sd-mr-1` EGO"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:17
msgid ""
"Sequential model-based optimization combining Gaussian Process regression"
" with the Expected Improvement acquisition function."
msgstr "Gaussian Process回帰と期待改善量(Expected Improvement)による逐次モデルベース最適化。"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:20
msgid "GP-UCB"
msgstr "{fa}`chart-line;sd-mr-1` GP-UCB"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:24
msgid ""
"Sequential model-based optimization combining Gaussian Process regression"
" with the Upper Confidence Bound acquisition function."
msgstr "Gaussian Process回帰と上側信頼限界(Upper Confidence Bound)による逐次モデルベース最適化。"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:27
msgid "MaxUnc"
msgstr "{fa}`magnifying-glass;sd-mr-1` MaxUnc"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:31
msgid ""
"Exploration-only sequential model-based optimization based solely on the "
"predictive uncertainty of Gaussian Process regression."
msgstr "Gaussian Process回帰の予測不確実性のみを基準にする、探索専用の逐次モデルベース最適化。"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:34
msgid "CORS-RBF"
msgstr "{fa}`circle-nodes;sd-mr-1` CORS-RBF"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:38
msgid ""
"Sequential model-based optimization combining an RBF-interpolation "
"surrogate model with a distance constraint from existing evaluated "
"points."
msgstr "RBF補間によるサロゲートモデルと、既存評価点からの距離制約による逐次モデルベース最適化。"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:41
msgid "NSGA-II"
msgstr "{fa}`people-arrows;sd-mr-1` NSGA-II"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:45
msgid ""
"Multi-objective genetic algorithm based on non-dominated sorting and "
"crowding distance. The basis for saealib's multi-objective comparators."
msgstr "非優越ソートと混雑度距離による多目的遺伝アルゴリズム。多目的最適化の比較演算子の基礎。"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:48
msgid "SPEA2"
msgstr "{fa}`weight-hanging;sd-mr-1` SPEA2"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:52
msgid ""
"Multi-objective genetic algorithm combining dominance-based strength and "
"density into a fitness value, with a fixed-size archive."
msgstr "支配関係に基づく強度と密度を組み合わせた適応度、固定サイズアーカイブによる多目的遺伝アルゴリズム。"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:55
msgid "NSGA-III"
msgstr "{fa}`bullseye;sd-mr-1` NSGA-III"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:59
msgid ""
"Multi-objective genetic algorithm with reference-point-based niche "
"preservation. Suited to many-objective optimization with four or more "
"objectives."
msgstr "参照点ベースのニッチ保存による多目的遺伝アルゴリズム。4つ以上の目的を持つmany-objective最適化向け。"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:62
msgid "SMS-EMOA"
msgstr "{fa}`chart-area;sd-mr-1` SMS-EMOA"

#: ../../../algorithms/index.md:66
msgid ""
"Steady-state multi-objective evolutionary algorithm that incorporates "
"dominated hypervolume directly into the selection criterion."
msgstr "被支配超体積を選択基準に直接組み込んだ、定常状態の多目的進化アルゴリズム。"

